<document ids="math-as-html-without-a-stylesheet" names="math\ as\ html\ without\ a\ stylesheet" source="testdata/fixtures/math_html_plain.rst" title="Math as HTML without a stylesheet">
    <title>
        Math as HTML without a stylesheet
    <paragraph>
        The 
        <literal>
            math_output
         setting is 
        <literal>
            HTML
         (no stylesheet option) for both HTML
        writers: 
        <math>
            \frac{a}{b} + \sqrt{x}
         and
    <math_block xml:space="preserve">
        \sum_{i=1}^n \left( \begin{matrix} a_i \\ b_i \end{matrix} \right)
